      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un combat entre deux Pokémon Spectre\nse joue sur leur Vitesse...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E00200063006F006D00620061007400200065006E0074007200650020006400650075007800200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200053007000650063007400720065000A007300650020006A006F0075006500200073007500720020006C00650075007200200056006900740065007300730065002E002E002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça t’intéresserait de savoir qui de nous deux\ns’y connaît le mieux en Pokémon Spectre ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Reviens me voir quand tu auras une équipe\nde type Spectre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065007600690065006E00730020006D006500200076006F006900720020007100750061006E006400200074007500200061007500720061007300200075006E0065002000E900710075006900700065000A006400650020007400790070006500200053007000650063007400720065002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je n’accepte aucun Pokémon n’ayant pas le type\nSpectre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E2019006100630063006500700074006500200061007500630075006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006E2019006100790061006E007400200070006100730020006C006500200074007900700065000A0053007000650063007400720065002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voyons qui de nous deux connaît le mieux\nles Pokémon Spectre...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0079006F006E007300200071007500690020006400650020006E006F007500730020006400650075007800200063006F006E006E006100EE00740020006C00650020006D0069006500750078000A006C0065007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200053007000650063007400720065002E002E002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voyons voir !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0079006F006E007300200076006F00690072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça ne m’intéresse pas...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C700610020006E00650020006D20190069006E007400E9007200650073007300650020007000610073002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hein ? Tu as une équipe de Pokémon Spectre,\nmais malgré tout, tu ne veux pas combattre ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ma stratégie est infaillible, même si ta Vitesse\nest supérieure à la mienne...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... J’ai perdu...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E0020004A201900610069002000700065007200640075002E002E002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je pensais qu’avec une Rune Sort, je pouvais\ncompenser la lenteur de mes Pokémon en<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nrenforçant leurs capacités Spectre...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je n’aurais pas dû sous-estimer cel<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂuile qui a réussi\nà réconcilier Nivis et Albia...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hein ?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650069006E0020003F002100100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quel est... ce frisson glacial... soudain...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750065006C0020006500730074002E002E002E002000630065002000660072006900730073006F006E00200067006C0061006300690061006C002E002E002E00200073006F0075006400610069006E002E002E002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "De quoi tu parles ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440065002000710075006F00690020007400750020007000610072006C006500730020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne sens rien, moi...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E0065002000730065006E00730020007200690065006E002C0020006D006F0069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu ne sens rien ? Tu ne sens pas ce frisson\nsinistre et menaçant contre ton échine ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLe Lugulabre d’Albia a-t-il entendu mes paroles\nirréfléchies ? S’apprête-t-il à absorber mon âme ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 191
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne mérite pas cette punition ! Je n’ai rien fait !\nJ’ai parlé sans réfléchir ! Je n’y suis pour rien !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nJe tiens à mon âme, je ne veux pas la perdre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 160
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah !\nLe frisson sinistre s’est arrêté... !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006800200021000A004C0065002000660072006900730073006F006E002000730069006E00690073007400720065002000732019006500730074002000610072007200EA007400E9002E002E002E0020002100100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le nom de Nivis reste tabou... même en\nl’absence d’Albia...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00650020006E006F006D0020006400650020004E00690076006900730020007200650073007400650020007400610062006F0075002E002E002E0020006D00EA006D006500200065006E000A006C20190061006200730065006E006300650020006420190041006C006200690061002E002E002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tiens, prends cette Rune Sort.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nElle augmente la puissance des capacités\nde type Spectre du Pokémon qui la tient.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMaintenant, laisse-moi.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
